```

## Best Practices Checklist

### Before Writing Tests
- [ ] Understand the function's purpose and behavior
- [ ] Identify all possible inputs and outputs
- [ ] List edge cases and error conditions
- [ ] Determine dependencies that need mocking
- [ ] Plan test strategy (unit/integration/component)

### While Writing Tests
- [ ] Use descriptive test names
- [ ] Follow AAA pattern (Arrange, Act, Assert)
- [ ] Test one thing per test case
- [ ] Use meaningful assertions
- [ ] Mock external dependencies appropriately

### After Writing Tests
- [ ] Run tests to ensure they pass
- [ ] Check coverage metrics
- [ ] Review test quality and readability
- [ ] Ensure tests are maintainable
- [ ] Document any complex test scenarios
